{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线首先落在左上方第一块大号白字和紫色强调词“忘了藏好喜欢”上；随后下方同样醒目的大字块“心里空落落的”争夺注意力。上下两块视觉权重接近。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他没藏住对对方的喜欢，对方看出了他有多在乎。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"空落落、担心被嫌太黏。\",\n  \"missed\": \"两种状态之间的具体变化：原先藏着心意时还能装作不在乎，如今被看出来后不知道怎么相处，亲近反而像隔了一层。交谈突然中止、怀疑这份幸福是否真实也不容易第一眼抓到。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字块争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块里，要拼起来才懂处境、感受及两者关系。\",\n    \"单块文字较长，包含前后对比、处境变化和心理担忧等多层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f8708a71-a82c-4612-bb03-dcbcd8b967ef", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011255299153Z", "elapsed_seconds": 29.672, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:13:24.978610+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f79983a6f63d07bc6edd9ae15b0c396531811d197e50341c439dde631f2b1c64", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgp